<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-020" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-020-hanlanying" source-id="s-nanqishu-020-hanlanying-ws2074177">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-hanlanying:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">吳郡<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hanlanying:p001:m0002" ref="8k5_lxv_2s6">韓藺英</persName>，婦人有文辭。宋孝武世，獻中興賦，被賞入宮。〔宋〕明帝世，用為宮中職僚。世祖以為博士，教六宮書學，以其年老多識，呼為「韓公」。</p>
</text>
